      "writtenOn": "2020-08-26T12:11:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Seems like a slightly odd construct. Isn\u0027t the \"go way\"\n    dexOutputFile, err \u003d ..\n    if err !\u003d nil\n\n?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2684,
        "startChar": 0,
